l7: $ G , x = ⟨ pp , ra_ctors_wf t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 t6 t7 ⟩ , x ∊ cl_ctors_wf_cons ⇒ ∃ D ∃ n_v ∃ np ∃ l_v ∃ i_v ∃ Ctx ∃ K ∃ C ∃ b_v ∃ P ∃ T ∃ R (t1 = D ∧ t2 = n_v ∧ t3 = np ∧ t4 = l_v ∧ t5 = i_v ∧ t6 = Ctx ∧ t7 = ⟨ kc_ccons , scons K (scons C ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_ind_data D b_v P T ∈ lrel ∧ ra_pis P K R ∈ lrel ∧ ra_closed n_v R ∈ lrel ∧ ra_cwf D n_v np l_v i_v Ctx ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ K ∈ lrel3 J ∧ ra_ctors_wf D n_v np l_v i_v Ctx C ∈ lrel3 J) $ by j2_ex12 [l2, l6]
