l1: $ G , ⟨ pp , ra_ctors_wf t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 t6 t7 ⟩ ∈ cl_ctors_wf_cons ⇒ ⟨ pp , ra_ctors_wf t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 t6 t7 ⟩ ∈ cl_ctors_wf_cons $ by ax
