l18: $ G , c = ra_tys_ty t1 t2 ⇒ ∃ Ctx (t1 = Ctx ∧ t2 = ⟨ kc_tnil , ∅ ⟩) ∨ ∃ Ctx ∃ F ∃ C ∃ T ∃ u_v ∃ l_v ∃ k_v (t1 = Ctx ∧ t2 = ⟨ kc_tcons , scons F (scons C (scons T ∅)) ⟩ ∧ ra_isort F k_v l_v ∈ lrel ∧ ra_deq Ctx F F ⟨ kc_srt , scons u_v ∅ ⟩ ∈ J ∧ ra_tys_ty Ctx T ∈ lrel3 J) $ by ex_elim [l8, l17]
