l1: $ G ⇒ ∃ G_v ∃ G2 ∃ D ∃ b_v ∃ P ∃ T (t1 = G_v ∧ t2 = D ∧ ra_ind_data D b_v P T ∈ lrel ∧ ra_tys_closed P T ∈ lrel ∧ ra_ctx_wf G_v P ∈ lrel3 J ∧ ra_capp P G_v G2 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_tys_ty G2 T ∈ lrel3 J) $ by j2_d_tys_ok_i [#1, #2]

