l6: $ G , x = ⟨ pp , ra_nst_ok t1 t2 t3 t4 ⟩ , x = ⟨ scons (ra_ind_wf y u) (scons (ra_nst_ty y z u g) (scons (ra_nst_ok y z w j) ∅)) , ra_nst_ok y z v ⟨ kc_cons , scons g (scons i ∅) ⟩ ⟩ ∧ ra_spine ⟨ kc_ind_ty , scons u (scons ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∅) ⟩ g a ∈ lrel ∧ ra_ind_arity u a b c ∈ lrel ∧ ra_ind_nested u k ∈ lrel ∧ ra_ndecl k b f ∈ lrel ∧ ra_le ⟨ kc_s , scons ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ f ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nst_group y z u g v ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ f ⟨ kc_cons , scons g (scons i ∅) ⟩ j ∈ lrel2 ∧ ra_add v f w ∈ lrel ⇒ ∃ G_v ∃ D ∃ I ∃ j_v ∃ j2 ∃ npi ∃ ni ∃ mi ∃ ni0 ∃ X ∃ N2 ∃ N3 ∃ NI (t1 = G_v ∧ t2 = D ∧ t3 = j_v ∧ t4 = ⟨ kc_cons , scons X (scons N2 ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_spine ⟨ kc_ind_ty , scons I (scons ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∅) ⟩ X npi ∈ lrel ∧ ra_ind_wf G_v I ∈ lrel3 J ∧ ra_ind_arity I npi ni mi ∈ lrel ∧ ra_ind_nested I NI ∈ lrel ∧ ra_ndecl NI ni ni0 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_le ⟨ kc_s , scons ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ ni0 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nst_ty G_v D I X ∈ lrel3 J ∧ ra_nst_group G_v D I X j_v ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ni0 ⟨ kc_cons , scons X (scons N2 ∅) ⟩ N3 ∈ lrel2 ∧ ra_add j_v ni0 j2 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nst_ok G_v D j2 N3 ∈ lrel3 J) $ by j2_e_nst_ok_cons [l3, l4, l5]
