l17: $ G , c = ra_nst_ok t1 t2 t3 t4 , ⟨ p , c ⟩ ∈ lprog3 J ∧ crn p ⊆ lrel3 J ⇒ ∃ G_v ∃ D ∃ j_v (t1 = G_v ∧ t2 = D ∧ t3 = j_v ∧ t4 = ⟨ kc_nil , ∅ ⟩) ∨ ∃ G_v ∃ D ∃ I ∃ j_v ∃ j2 ∃ npi ∃ ni ∃ mi ∃ ni0 ∃ X ∃ N2 ∃ N3 ∃ NI (t1 = G_v ∧ t2 = D ∧ t3 = j_v ∧ t4 = ⟨ kc_cons , scons X (scons N2 ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_spine ⟨ kc_ind_ty , scons I (scons ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∅) ⟩ X npi ∈ lrel ∧ ra_ind_wf G_v I ∈ lrel3 J ∧ ra_ind_arity I npi ni mi ∈ lrel ∧ ra_ind_nested I NI ∈ lrel ∧ ra_ndecl NI ni ni0 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_le ⟨ kc_s , scons ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ ni0 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nst_ty G_v D I X ∈ lrel3 J ∧ ra_nst_group G_v D I X j_v ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ni0 ⟨ kc_cons , scons X (scons N2 ∅) ⟩ N3 ∈ lrel2 ∧ ra_add j_v ni0 j2 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nst_ok G_v D j2 N3 ∈ lrel3 J) $ by j2_o_nst_ok [l16, l11]
