l2: $ G ⇒ ra_closed ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ V2 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_deq V1 V2 V2 ⟨ kc_pi , scons tr_nat_ty (scons ⟨ kc_pi , scons tr_nat_ty (scons tr_nat_ty ∅) ⟩ ∅) ⟩ ∈ J ∧ ra_deq ⟨ kc_cons , scons tr_nat_ty (scons V1 ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_app , scons ⟨ kc_app , scons V2 (scons ⟨ kc_bvar , scons ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ ∅) ⟩ (scons tr_nat_zero ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_bvar , scons ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ tr_nat_ty ∈ J ∧ ra_deq ⟨ kc_cons , scons tr_nat_ty (scons ⟨ kc_cons , scons tr_nat_ty (scons V1 ∅) ⟩ ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_app , scons ⟨ kc_app , scons V2 (scons ⟨ kc_bvar , scons ⟨ kc_s , scons ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ ∅) ⟩ (scons ⟨ kc_app , scons tr_nat_succ (scons ⟨ kc_bvar , scons ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ ∅) ⟩ ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_app , scons tr_nat_succ (scons ⟨ kc_app , scons ⟨ kc_app , scons V2 (scons ⟨ kc_bvar , scons ⟨ kc_s , scons ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ ∅) ⟩ (scons ⟨ kc_bvar , scons ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ ∅) ⟩ ∅) ⟩ tr_nat_ty ∈ J $ by and_elim_r [#2]
