  $ G ⇒ ∃ G_v ∃ fd ∃ fm ∃ fmul ∃ fadd ∃ h1 ∃ h2 ∃ h3 (t1 = G_v ∧ t2 = fd ∧ t3 = fm ∧ t4 = fmul ∧ t5 = fadd ∧ ra_mul_eqs G_v fmul fadd ∈ lrel3 J ∧ ra_closed ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ fd ∈ lrel ∧ ra_closed ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ fm ∈ lrel ∧ ra_deq G_v fd fd ⟨ kc_pi , scons tr_nat_ty (scons ⟨ kc_pi , scons tr_nat_ty (scons tr_nat_ty ∅) ⟩ ∅) ⟩ ∈ J ∧ ra_deq G_v fm fm ⟨ kc_pi , scons tr_nat_ty (scons ⟨ kc_pi , scons tr_nat_ty (scons tr_nat_ty ∅) ⟩ ∅) ⟩ ∈ J ∧ ra_deq G_v h1 h1 ⟨ kc_pi , scons tr_nat_ty (scons ⟨ kc_pi , scons tr_nat_ty (scons ⟨ kc_app , scons ⟨ kc_app , scons j2_c1 (scons ⟨ kc_app , scons ⟨ kc_app , scons fadd (scons ⟨ kc_app , scons ⟨ kc_app , scons fmul (scons ⟨ kc_bvar , scons ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ ∅) ⟩ (scons ⟨ kc_app , scons ⟨ kc_app , scons fd (scons ⟨ kc_bvar , scons ⟨ kc_s , scons ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ ∅) ⟩ (scons ⟨ kc_bvar , scons ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ ∅) ⟩ ∅) ⟩ ∅) ⟩ (scons ⟨ kc_app , scons ⟨ kc_app , scons fm (scons ⟨ kc_bvar , scons ⟨ kc_s , scons ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ ∅) ⟩ (scons ⟨ kc_bvar , scons ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ ∅) ⟩ ∅) ⟩ ∅) ⟩ (scons ⟨ kc_bvar , scons ⟨ kc_s , scons ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ ∅) ⟩ ∅) ⟩ ∅) ⟩ ∈ J ∧ ra_deq G_v h2 h2 ⟨ kc_pi , scons tr_nat_ty (scons ⟨ kc_pi , scons tr_nat_ty (scons ⟨ kc_pi , scons j2_c2 (scons ⟨ kc_app , scons ⟨ kc_app , scons ⟨ kc_ind_ty , scons tr_le_D (scons ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∅) ⟩ (scons ⟨ kc_app , scons tr_nat_succ (scons ⟨ kc_app , scons ⟨ kc_app , scons fm (scons ⟨ kc_bvar , scons ⟨ kc_s , scons ⟨ kc_s , scons ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ ∅) ⟩ (scons ⟨ kc_bvar , scons ⟨ kc_s , scons ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ ∅) ⟩ ∅) ⟩ ∅) ⟩ (scons ⟨ kc_bvar , scons ⟨ kc_s , scons ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ ∅) ⟩ ∅) ⟩ ∅) ⟩ ∅) ⟩ ∈ J ∧ ra_deq G_v h3 h3 ⟨ kc_pi , scons tr_nat_ty (scons ⟨ kc_app , scons ⟨ kc_app , scons j2_c1 (scons ⟨ kc_app , scons ⟨ kc_app , scons fd (scons ⟨ kc_bvar , scons ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ ∅) ⟩ (scons ⟨ kc_lit , scons ⟨ kc_b0 , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ ∅) ⟩ ∅) ⟩ (scons ⟨ kc_lit , scons ⟨ kc_b0 , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ ∅) ⟩ ∅) ⟩ ∈ J) $
