lemma j2_d_gcd_eqs_i (G: hyps) (J: class) {G_v f_v fd fm fmul fadd h1 h2: set} (pp t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 t6: set):
  $ G ⇒ ⟨ pp , ra_gcd_eqs t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 t6 ⟩ ∈ cl_gcd_eqs_i J $ > $ G ⇒ crn pp ⊆ lrel3 J $ >
  $ G ⇒ ∃ G_v ∃ f_v ∃ fd ∃ fm ∃ fmul ∃ fadd ∃ h1 ∃ h2 (t1 = G_v ∧ t2 = f_v ∧ t3 = fd ∧ t4 = fm ∧ t5 = fmul ∧ t6 = fadd ∧ ra_divmod_eqs G_v fd fm fmul fadd ∈ lrel3 J ∧ ra_closed ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ f_v ∈ lrel ∧ ra_deq G_v f_v f_v ⟨ kc_pi , scons tr_nat_ty (scons ⟨ kc_pi , scons tr_nat_ty (scons tr_nat_ty ∅) ⟩ ∅) ⟩ ∈ J ∧ ra_deq G_v h1 h1 ⟨ kc_pi , scons tr_nat_ty (scons ⟨ kc_app , scons ⟨ kc_app , scons j2_c1 (scons ⟨ kc_app , scons ⟨ kc_app , scons f_v (scons ⟨ kc_lit , scons ⟨ kc_b0 , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ ∅) ⟩ (scons ⟨ kc_bvar , scons ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ ∅) ⟩ ∅) ⟩ (scons ⟨ kc_bvar , scons ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ ∅) ⟩ ∅) ⟩ ∈ J ∧ ra_deq G_v h2 h2 ⟨ kc_pi , scons tr_nat_ty (scons ⟨ kc_pi , scons tr_nat_ty (scons ⟨ kc_app , scons ⟨ kc_app , scons j2_c1 (scons ⟨ kc_app , scons ⟨ kc_app , scons f_v j2_c0 ⟩ (scons ⟨ kc_bvar , scons ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ ∅) ⟩ ∅) ⟩ (scons ⟨ kc_app , scons ⟨ kc_app , scons f_v (scons ⟨ kc_app , scons ⟨ kc_app , scons fm (scons ⟨ kc_bvar , scons ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ ∅) ⟩ j2_c0 ⟩ ∅) ⟩ j2_c0 ⟩ ∅) ⟩ ∅) ⟩ ∅) ⟩ ∈ J) $
